{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/6","id":4914043552,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVMZGKc8AAAABJOZaoA","html_url":"https://github.com/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pull/6","diff_url":"https://github.com/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pull/6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pull/6.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/issues/6","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/6/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/6/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/issues/6/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/statuses/b0e894db53d58370df0d9959e070a1302f4a5787","number":6,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Research: claim-aware ERC-8404 consumer without Core changes","user":{"login":"pipavlo82","id":212635108,"node_id":"U_kgDODKyN5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212635108?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82","html_url":"https://github.com/pipavlo82","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds an external consumer that binds a narrow artifact-identity authorization to an independently supplied scenario contract, authenticated review, scenario-dependent checker independence and explicit consumed claim scope. Existing RVR receipt bytes, Core sources and historical v0-v4 evidence are preserved.\n\nThis Draft PR is stacked on #4 (ee1143f2b8f669a88f36c736d20bb86c2ade950a). It does not change #2/#3/#4 or main. No upstream PR or merge is requested.\n\nValidation: 45 scenarios, 17 tests in normal/repeat/Python -O; corrected mutation inventory: 16 killed, 1 survived, no crashes. The surviving contract-preimage fallback still refuses when both carriers are absent; this boundary is not certified as isolated mutation coverage. The initial 17-kill witness retained a second preimage carrier; its evidence is preserved and superseded explicitly. Semantic outputs are deterministic. Historical v0-v4 suites and original mutation classifications were reproduced. Frozen Core: 13 vendored files and all 75 tracked upstream files unchanged. Genuine laboratory EIP-712 signatures are checked by Node and eth-account; RVR Python/TypeScript gates replay independently.\n\nSee research/erc8404/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md for comparative counts and raw evidence. A/B results measure intentionally incomplete downstream lifts, not defects in ERC-8404. Contract adequacy remains external. No external execution, judgment truth, full real chain, scientific novelty or general security claim is made.\n\nRecommendation: COMPATIBLE_WITH_FROZEN_CORE for this external consumer route. A new normative Verification Profile and deployed ERC-8274/WYRIWE/8412 integration are not claimed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T00:14:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:24:06Z","closed_at":null,"m